    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to bring to the market this three bedroom semi-detached bungalow. Located in the townland of Toberoneill just two kilometers from the village of Ballindrait comes this South facing property with with lawns to the front and rear, off-road ample parking and large detached garage. Internal accommodation comprises hallway, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms, second reception room and bathroom. Some of the many features of this property includes high ceilings with Velux windows, a spacious hallway and dual fuel central heating. This property is offered for sale at a very realistic guide price and must be viewed to be appreciated. All enquiries welcome."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Three bedroom semi-detached bungalow<br><br>\nHallway - 5.80m x 2.25m + 5.45m x 1.55m <br>Velux window.\nTiled floor.\nTwo radiators.\nThree centre ceiling lights.\nPVC glass panel front door.\nTwo radiators.\n<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.10m x 3.00m <br>Front facing window.\nLaminate timber floor.\nOpen fireplace with timber surround connected to back boiler.\n1 radiator.\nCentre ceiling light.\n<br><br><br>\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.15m x 4.15m <br>High & low level kitchen units.\nTiled in between.\nFour ring electric hob.\nOven & grill.\nStainless steel sink.\nWashing machine (included).\nTimber ceiling.\nCentre ceiling light.\nFront facing window.\n1 radiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.10m x 3.15m <br>Two gable windows.\n;aminate timber floor.\n1 radiator.\nCentre ceiling light.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.15m x 3.10m <br>Velux window.\nLaminate timber floor.\n1 radiator.\nCentre ceiling light.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 4.55m x 2.95m <br>Rear facing window.\nLaminate timber floor.\n1 radiator.\nCentre ceiling light.\n<br><br><br>\n2nd Sitting Room - 6.50m x 5.75m <br>French doors.\nOpen fireplace with timber surround.\nLaminate timber floor.\nFive stem centre ceiling light.\n1 radiator.\nTwo rear facing windows.\n<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.25m x 2.15m <br>WC.\nWHB.\nElectric shower.\nVelux window.\nFully tiled walls.\nCentre ceiling light.\n1 radiator.\n<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Dual fuel central heating.\nPVC double glazed windows throughout.\nPeaceful & very convenient location.\nDetached garage at rear of property.\nOff-road ample parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
